{"id":"553842711","kind":"article","title":"探尝","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sampling"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-08-15","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":7,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":285,"keywords":["探索","学习内驱力","儿童发展","职业选择","兴趣"],"summary":"术语条目将“探尝”定义为随新信息调整目标和职业选择的探索过程，常见于儿童。作者认为，这并非缺乏专注，而可能是学习内驱力引导的尝试；例如孩子试过多种运动后，发现某项更适合自己而放弃其他选择。文中还把寻找朋友或伴侣比作类似过程。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/553842711","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"wZ06vm80\"><b>探尝</b>是随着获知新信息而切换目标和职业选择的探索过程，以儿童居多。虽然成年人通常认为探尝中的儿童不够一心一意，从一而终，但这个过程实际上是由<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>引导的。参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimality_of_the_learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力的优化</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。例如，孩子可能会接连尝试好几种运动，最终发现他长得挺高，打篮球很有优势。他会放弃其他选择，比如马术。</p><p data-pid=\"EBkHkgpb\">寻找朋友或伴侣的过程往往类似于<b>探尝</b>。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"wy5kRek-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sampling - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语表</a>条目用于解释《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Problem_of_Schooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我永远不会送我的孩子去学校</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>》<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>（2017）作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Piotr Wozniak</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学习内驱力的优化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"357209357\" href=\"#/post/357209357\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 《我永远不会送我的孩子去学校》 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 学校教育的问题 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"611469462\" href=\"#/post/611469462\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"553589889","title":"元认知支持作为认知脚手架","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":8,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"555439275","title":"学校如何扼杀创造力？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":138,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"357209357","title":"学习内驱力的最优性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":60,"minutes":14,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"611469462","title":"学校教育的问题","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":446,"minutes":10,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"656354242","title":"妈妈们对把孩子送去托儿所感到愧疚","author":"Eden Strong","votes":20,"minutes":2,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「儿童发展」· Eden Strong"},{"id":"579804264","title":"福山：未来社会将按照涌现而成的社会规范自我组织","aut